      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We have \\[ (10^y)^2=25. \\] Since \\(10^y\\) is positive, \\(10^y=5.\\) Taking the reciprocal gives \\(10^{-y}=\\frac{1}{5}.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
